# FIELD-MEM p2: the geometry pool is sized for the scene at open and gives empty pages back at a scene change.
# Proof: editor.log - at each open ONE "[GeometryPool] RT_Reserve ... = sum of meshes + 1/8" line and no
# "[GeometryPool] page +load" line; after leaving FIELD_Barn "[GeometryPool] released N empty page(s)";
# 0 [error], 0 VUID; the field frame as in p1.
Дано run Scene "Open Scene FIELD_Barn.desce"
Дано run View "View mode: Lit"
Дано --subject viewport set Camera.Position 0,900,2500
Дано --subject viewport set Camera.Direction 0.15,-0.15,-1
Тогда 1_barn the scene opened: the field is drawn (grass to the far edge), the editor alive
Когда run Scene "Open Scene Starter.desce"
Тогда 2_starter the second scene opened and draws; FIELD_Barn's pool pages released in the log
Когда run Scene "Open Scene FIELD_Barn.desce"
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Position 0,900,2500
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Direction 0.15,-0.15,-1
Тогда 3_barn_again FIELD_Barn again: the field as in 1_barn, one RT_Reserve line for this open, no page +load
